+       <dt class="hdlist1">
+        <span class="monospaced">
+         Management VLAN
+        </span>
+       </dt>
+       <dd>
+        <p>
+         Tags the management network with the given
+         <span class="monospaced">
+          VLAN Tag
+         </span>
+         , for networks that are
+only reachable tagged. The bridge
+         <span class="monospaced">
+          vmbr0
+         </span>
+         then becomes VLAN-aware and the host
+address is configured on the interface
+         <span class="monospaced">
+          vlan&lt;tag&gt;
+         </span>
+         on top of it, so that guests
+can still use other VLANs on the bridge. Valid tags are 2 to 4094, as the
+VLAN-aware bridge sends VLAN 1 untagged. Leave the VLAN setup disabled for an
+untagged management network.
+        </p>
